       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SCODEDEL.
       AUTHOR.         C.I.HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   4/1/86.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
      *REMARKS.
      *D   THIS SUBPROGRAM DELETES A CORPORATE CODE FROM THE
      *D   STORES DATABASE AND CREATES A TRANSACTION TO BE PASSED TO
      *D   THE CORPORATE SYSTEM INFORMING OF THE DELETION.
      *
      *    04/09/86.
      *      SINCE ALL DATABASES ARE NOT UP TO DATE, HAD TO CHANGE
      *      PROGRAM TO CHECK FOR COND CODE 52 ON DBDELETE OF "DCODE" -
      *      SINCE OLD VERSIONS OF DATABASE DONT HAVE CORP-CODE AS
      *      A SEARCH ITEM IN THIS DATA SET.  NOTE - WHOEVER MAKES A
      *      DATABASE CHANGE SHOULD BE RESPONSIBLE FOR GETTING ALL
      *      PLANTS UP TO DATE.
      *      CIH.
      *
      *    05/09/86.
      *      CHANGED PROGRAM TO NOT ALLOW CODE DELETION IF THE CODE
      *      IS FROZEN.  THIS CAUSED THE PROCESS INVENTORY WORKSHEET
      *      PROGRAM TO ABEND.  CIH.
      *C
      *C  08/19/92  BK DISMUKES   REQUEST 6525
      *C     1. ADDED LOGIC TO DELETE RESTRICTION TABLE FROM DRESTRIC
      *C        WHEN A CODE IS DELETED FROM MSTORERM.
      *C     2. CHANGED READ SCREEN LOGIC SO IT WOULD WORK.  COPYLIB
      *C        MEMBERS HAD BEEN CHANGED AND NO LONGER WORKED TOGERHER.
      *C
      *C  09/14/93  JS BUNGO      REQUEST 6420
      *C     ADDED CALL TO SJOBPCOD TO DELETE THE CODE FROM THE
      *C     MMISA PM-JOBPLAN WHEN A CODE IS DELETED FROM STORES.
      *C
      *C  09/20/93  JS BUNGO      REQUEST 5643
      *C     ADDED CALL TO SCCLKCHG TO DELETE THE CODE FROM THE
      *C     MMISA CORP-CODE-LINK AND CC-NOTE-MSTR WHEN A CODE IS
      *C     DELETED FROM STORES.
      *C
      *C  01/28/94  JS BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CALL TO SCCALTCH TO DELETE THE CODE FROM THE
      *C     THE ALTERNATE KEY FILE WHEN A CODE IS DELETED.
      *C
      *C  09/12/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   1/14/97    BILL ROXBURY REQ #95-012
      *C     DELETE ENTRIES FROM NEW RECEIVING FILE (MCFLCSRCPT).
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT USAGEFIL-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT RECEIPTFIL-CD-O
